{"version":1,"content":"<p>政府今早舉行記者會，進一步交代宏福苑大火後，政府改革樓宇維修監管制度和支援詳情。</p><p>財政司副司長兼署理房屋局長黃偉綸、發展局長甯漢豪二人出席記者會發言時，各自為宏福苑火災對災民帶來悲痛和社會哀傷而致歉。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T04:18:15.752308+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":100,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T03:45:45+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T10:22:16.971040+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T04:18:15.752308+00:00","content_hash":"cefc6db8e83f53aa144bb61d40bf641e0d86ba2c61e0337ceb9c238a2e888184","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}